    "body": "It does seem like this would be helped by @beikeland telling us what application he was actually building and needed these for. Given that some of the schemes are inaccurate, it's not clear whether the OP was a web developer planning to use these concrete schemes, or a vague feature request. If it was the latter, perhaps we should close this request.",
